  n269 [label=<<B>Nvidia</B><BR/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13">AI chipmaker; Huang reinstated<BR/>as President, CEO and director<BR/>Nov 22 2026 (8-K); Kress<BR/>remains EVP/CFO after serving<BR/>as interim CEO; Chair Harvey<BR/>C. Jones; new National<BR/>Security and Export Control<BR/>Committee of independent<BR/>directors and a CCO search; CA<BR/>AG Bonta investigative<BR/>subpoena Nov 19 (no response<BR/>or 8-K through Nov 23); GC<BR/>Teter Form 4 filed Nov 23<BR/>(30,000 sh sold Nov 19 under a<BR/>May 22 2026 10b5-1 plan); SEC<BR/>probe still reported only;<BR/>$10.0B of Anthropic Class N<BR/>(placement closed Nov 20);<BR/>Trump SAID Nov 24 a US equity<BR/>stake is 'probably not too<BR/>late' (NY Post; not raised; no<BR/>filing); S&amp;P put its AA<BR/>ratings on CreditWatch<BR/>negative Nov 25 2026 (M&amp;G<BR/>modifier to neutral; 90-day<BR/>review); Bloomberg (Nov 27):<BR/>Blackwell GB300 rack at an<BR/>Alice Huang-linked Shanghai<BR/>site; Nvidia did not respond</FONT>>];
