  n363 [label=<<B>Megaspeed (Singapore; Entity List Nov 2026)</B><BR/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13">Singapore-based data-center<BR/>company (Megaspeed<BR/>International Pte. Ltd. +<BR/>Malaysian/Thai/Singapore<BR/>affiliates MSFusion, PT<BR/>Megaspeed International,<BR/>Speedmatrix, Apex Enterprise<BR/>Solutions, Swiftdata,<BR/>Megaspeed (Thailand)); added<BR/>to the BIS Entity List Nov 23<BR/>2026; DOJ/Commerce export-<BR/>control probe (Nov 17 joint<BR/>statement); former executive<BR/>Alice Huang; same rule lists<BR/>Alibaba's Singapore unit Apex<BR/>Enterprise Solutions<BR/>(Speedmatrix pledged<BR/>equipment/IP to Apex, Jun<BR/>2024; Straits Times); Federal<BR/>Register prints the rule Nov<BR/>25 (not yet in the FR API at<BR/>11:40 PM EST Nov 24)</FONT>>];
